  },
  {
   "id": 228,
   "en": "Sean",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 229,
   "en": "Captain, we've arrived at Hindan Base.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 230,
   "en": "What altitude did they designate?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 231,
   "en": "30.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 232,
   "en": "Then <TD Hovering> at that altitude.@Begin resupply operations.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 233,
   "en": "Understood.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 234,
   "en": "And summon the mobile unit leaders.@I'll explain our operational plans going forward.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 235,
   "en": "Hiryu Custom, Mess Hall",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 236,
   "en": "Melua",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 237,
   "en": "It was the same in Taiwan, but this ship@gets resupplied without landing, doesn't it?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 238,
   "en": "Yeah. The Hiryu has wings on its underside too,@so if it landed as-is, it'd stab into the ground.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 239,
   "en": "Mizuho",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 240,
   "en": "This ship and the Space Noah-class are especially@big, so they need a special dock to land. Where@there isn't one, they moor floating a bit off the ground.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 241,
   "en": "Like the airships of the old days...@back in the Old Calendar era.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 242,
   "en": "That's right. You know your stuff.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 243,
   "en": "Tenia",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 244,
   "en": "Hehe, I got them to give me@an extra-large second helping of rice.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 245,
   "en": "Good for you, Tenia.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 246,
   "en": "That much in a bowl... Was your first one@like that too?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 247,
   "en": "Yeah.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 248,
   "en": "How can you eat so much?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 249,
   "en": "Aw, so you're the type to say stuff like that, Touya.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 250,
   "en": "Huh?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 251,
   "en": "That's rude, Touya. Even if you notice how much@a girl is eating, I think you should pretend@you didn't.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 252,
   "en": "Was it?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 253,
   "en": "Wait, are you... the type who'd just straight-up@ask a girl for her numbers?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 254,
   "en": "Numbers?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 255,
   "en": "Like age or weight.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 256,
   "en": "Even I wouldn't do that...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 257,
   "en": "If you ever make some stupid joke@about my weight, you'll be sorry.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 258,
   "en": "I wasn't going to say anything like that...@But when we first met you, Tenia,@you didn't eat like you do now, right?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 259,
   "en": "So what about it?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 260,
   "en": "If you can eat properly now, isn't that a good thing?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 261,
   "en": "Huh...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 262,
   "en": "That's right.@Being able to eat properly is important.@It's the basics of being human, or any living thing.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 263,
   "en": "Y-Yeah...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 264,
   "en": "(You can say nice things too, huh, Touya?)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 265,
   "en": "Hiryu Custom - Briefing Room",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 266,
   "en": "Everyone's here.@Before I explain our operational plans...@Lieutenant Kyosuke Nanbu.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 267,
   "en": "Sir!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 268,
   "en": "During this operation, I'm leaving you in@command of the Lefina detachment's@mobile forces.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 269,
   "en": "...Isn't there someone better suited?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 270,
   "en": "Of the military pilots in the detachment,@you hold the highest rank.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 271,
   "en": "With Commander Miles watching, Sänger and I, who are@not even <Military Contractor> personnel, can't very@well take command.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 272,
   "en": "Besides, you have a track record.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 273,
   "en": "That's right, you did fine in that one operation.@No need to hold back, Kyosuke.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 274,
   "en": "Roger. Then I'll take command.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 275,
   "en": "Now, I'll explain our upcoming operation. The largest@number of Lamaris currently confirmed is in Karachi,@Pakistan.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 276,
   "en": "Forces there barely managed to contain the Lamaris,@but it's a stalemate... and the evacuation of@residents on Karachi's outskirts isn't complete.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 277,
   "en": "In Dr. Kenzou Kobayashi's view, it's highly likely@the Lamaris will absorb the malice of those who@didn't escape in time and multiply all at once.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 278,
   "en": "(If that happens, the damage will spread in a chain...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 279,
   "en": "So after resupply is complete, we'll make a space@transition above Karachi and wipe out the Lamaris.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 280,
   "en": "Splitting the fleet halved our strength, so we must@lure the Lamaris with <T-LINK System> and <Sympathia>@units and destroy them efficiently.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 281,
   "en": "Six <Telekinetic> pilots, three Sympathia users...@If they all sortie, we may manage somehow.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 282,
   "en": "And we've been given@one more role.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 283,
   "en": "Drawing the Fury's attention, right?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 284,
   "en": "Yes. That's why the Joint Chiefs of Staff assigned@the Granteed and Bellzelute to this ship.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 285,
   "en": "So that way, the Fury won't@get in the way of@Operation Triumph?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 286,
   "en": "That's right.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 287,
   "en": "So we're supposed to make a big show of being bait?@Well, that's a mission right up our alley.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 288,
   "en": "Eun",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 289,
   "en": "Captain, a spatial distortion has been detected@directly above Hindan Base. It's likely a sign of@those rings of light. Please come to the bridge.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 290,
   "en": "Understood.@Lieutenant Kyosuke, launch at once.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 291,
   "en": "Roger.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 292,
   "en": "Rings of light... The remnants of the <Dark Brain>.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 293,
   "en": "So we'll be bait not only for the Fury,@but for them as well...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 294,
   "en": "Numerous Lamaris emerging from the rings!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 295,
   "en": "I can't believe they're transitioning in...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 296,
   "en": "That's never happened before.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 297,
   "en": "Another ring of light above the base! One of them!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 298,
   "en": "Hurry and deploy the mobile forces!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 299,
   "en": "Heh, perfect timing, eh?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 300,
   "en": "So you're the one who brought the Lamaris, huh?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 301,
   "en": "So Debudedabide captured those Lamaris in Jakarta@to use them as a fighting force after all...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 302,
   "en": "If you think that's gonna beat us,@don't make me laugh!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 303,
   "en": "Don't get cocky, brat.@I'll go easy on ya, so bring it on.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 304,
   "en": "Don't need to tell me twice!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 305,
   "en": "(...Well then, lemme test this out.)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 306,
   "en": "(The Fury must have noticed the Steel Dragons@split in two... To think they'd move first.)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 307,
   "en": "Assault 1 to all units.@If we take too long, Kaana types will appear.@We'll hit them fast.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 308,
   "en": "(...What the heck? They ain't changin'.@Did that dimwit read it wrong?)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 309,
   "en": "(Can't be helped. Guess I'll keep 'em pinned.)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 310,
   "en": "(Hmph... Kuri's probably drawn a dud too.@Well, I was only gonna play around today anyway.)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 311,
   "en": "We'll settle this later, Roa.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 312,
   "en": "That bastard!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 313,
   "en": "Roa",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 314,
   "en": "Don't chase him, Kota.@The Lamaris extermination in Karachi@takes priority.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 315,
   "en": "Ngh...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 316,
   "en": "Skull Knight is leaving the combat area!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 317,
   "en": "Tch, like I'm lettin' you get away!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 318,
   "en": "Don't chase him, Kota. There are still Lamaris left.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 319,
   "en": "Ngh... Fine, I get it.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 320,
   "en": "All enemy signals in the combat area are gone.@No hostiles within search range.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 321,
   "en": "The ship will hold <TD Hovering> at its current@position. All units, maintain strict all-around@vigilance.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 322,
   "en": "...In the end, the Lamaris never turned@into Kaana types, did they?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 323,
   "en": "Is it because we have fewer members than usual...?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 324,
   "en": "...I think the location has something@to do with it too.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 325,
   "en": "What do you mean?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 326,
   "en": "Malice isn't stagnating here@as much as in other cities.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 327,
   "en": "So there wasn't enough fertilizer, then.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 328,
   "en": "Then what, the Skull jerk was just@plantin' seeds or somethin'?@What for?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 329,
   "en": "Most likely, he...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 330,
   "en": "Incoming message from Hindan Base HQ!@Debudedabide has appeared at the Lamaris@concentration in Karachi!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 331,
   "en": "!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 332,
   "en": "It seems we weren't the only ones@playing the decoy.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 333,
   "en": "Throwin' a whole bunch of Lamaris at us@ain't gonna beat us!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 334,
   "en": "Can't be helped. Then I'll take ya on myself.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 335,
   "en": "Makin' the Lamaris your lackeys won't do ya any good!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 336,
   "en": "(Well, you go on thinkin' that. Suits me better anyway.)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 337,
   "en": "Captain, all mobile units have been recovered.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 338,
   "en": "And the space transition preparations?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 339,
   "en": "Karachi's coordinates have been measured.@We can transition immediately.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 340,
   "en": "Then we'll execute the space transition at once.@Notify all hands.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 341,
   "en": "Roger, notifying all hands of the space transition.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  }
 ]
}